OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see showers, some longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain in the west at first. Then
OL,8,Fshowers becoming fewer and lighter
OL,9,Fduring the early hours. Strong
OL,10,Fwesterly winds easing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA few light showers at first,
OL,13,Fotherwise a dry start. Rain will
OL,14,Fspread from the west during the late
OL,15,Fmorning and afternoon, turning light
OL,16,Fand patchy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
