OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith showers on Saturday, fresh to
OL,7,Fstrong westerly winds. A few early
OL,8,Fshowers on Sunday, otherwise dry. Rain
OL,9,Fwill spread northeast for a time on
OL,10,FMonday, then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
